From c15eb170dbfdf6bfb2b99881692c5651db85d975 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrLGamer <mrlgam3r@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:37:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] protonfixes: add ReShade downloader

ReShade is extracted from the official setup exe and deployed into
`drive_c/reshade/`, i.e.

```
PROTON_USE_RESHADE=1 %command%
```

Setting a version number instead of `1` pins the release and
`PROTON_RESHADE_ADDON=1` gets the full add-on variant, which skips the
network-activity add-on lockout.

Shaders, textures and presets are host-side in `$XDG_DATA_HOME/reshade` and
symlinked into the prefix (`PROTON_RESHADE_PATH` overrides the location, `=0`
opts out), the standard effect pack is installed on first use. The overlay
opens with the Home key. Without an XXMI importer ReShade takes the dxgi
slot, so it can't be combined with OptiScaler; with one it gets injected
next to 3dmigoto instead.
